'           -                   IT CANNOT HAVE A CUSTOM UNDO RECORD. Version 2.0 opened one so
'           -                   Ctrl+Z would take the job back in a single press, and it CRASHED
'           -                   WORD - access violation in wwlib.dll, nothing raised, nothing
